<title>USA: Ottawa Financial completes share buyback.</title>
<headline>Ottawa Financial completes share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLAND, Mich. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ottawa Financial Corp said Thursday it has completed the repurchase of 258,964, or about five percent, of its outstanding common stock at an average price of $19.52 per share.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares became treasury shares and will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>Ottawa Financial shares were down 3/4 at 21-3/4 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
